Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.85,0:04:07.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:36.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(抱歉 车很脏)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.10,0:01:30.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(惠伦有限责任合伙律所)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.14,0:03:18.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(搭车者可能为逃犯)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.06,0:11:11.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(治疗童年受虐者)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.30,0:26:27.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,(治疗童年受虐者)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.66,0:01:07.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.97,0:04:11.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后就是你和贝丝两个人了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was just you and Beth after?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.86,0:04:13.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 是啊 - 你救了她吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - You save her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.36,0:04:16.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她很坚强 她救了自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's tough. She saved herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.29,0:04:20.07,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起流浪了一段时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were out there for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.65,0:04:23.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们被困住了 她先闯出去了 然后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got cornered, she got out in front of me and...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:25.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 她不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, she was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.47,0:04:27.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我出来时 一辆车开走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came out and a car's pulling out
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.74,0:04:29.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车窗上有白十字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a white cross on the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.69,0:04:32.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 就像那辆车吗？- 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just like that one? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.95,0:04:49.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克会想知道我们去了哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rick's gonna wonder where we went.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.91,0:04:52.14,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,油箱里快没油了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tank's running low.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.49,0:04:56.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能很快结束这一切 把他撞下公路就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can end this quick. Just run him off the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.20,0:04:58.84,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 远远跟着就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah, we're good for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.57,0:05:00.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们把她关在了某个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they're holding her somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.56,0:05:02.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以逼问司机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can get it out of the driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.65,0:05:05.06,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 但如果他不肯开口 我们又回到起点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but if he don't talk, we're back to square one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.04,0:05:07.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们有优势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now we got the advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.58,0:05:10.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会搞清他们的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll see who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.54,0:05:12.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们是一伙人 看看他们的实力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they're a group, see what they can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.87,0:05:16.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们就去尽力救她回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then we'll do what we gotta do to get her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.12,0:05:21.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在往北边走 I-85公路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're heading north, I-85.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.22,0:06:13.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在等什么呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's he waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.54,0:06:31.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有两个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.15,0:06:36.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是警察吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that a cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.87,0:06:44.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们可能看见我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They might've seen us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.19,0:08:02.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死 油箱没油了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, shit! Tank's tapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.29,0:08:05.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们本可以走支路的 但他们没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'd have taken the bypass and they didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.70,0:08:07.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们肯定藏身在城市的某个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must be holed up in the city somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.40,0:08:17.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走了 找个地方藏起来 等到天亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta move, find someplace to hole up till sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.96,0:08:21.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道一个地方 离这里就几个街区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know a place just a couple of blocks from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.20,0:08:22.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.30,0:08:38.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 又来了两只 - 就快打开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Two more. - I almost got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.23,0:08:43.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.01,0:09:57.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以前在这工作过吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You used to work here or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.54,0:10:00.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.98,0:11:08.98,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是哪？- 临时住所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's this place? - It's temporary housing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.71,0:11:16.60,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来过？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.21,0:11:19.64,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没留多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.79,0:11:31.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我睡上铺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take the top bunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.17,0:11:34.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下铺更适合你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that one's more your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.62,0:11:39.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你睡吧 我先守夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should sleep. I'll take first watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.23,0:11:43.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这里封锁得很严 - 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is locked up pretty tight. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:47.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就很安全啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we're good, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.52,0:11:50.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想守夜 我不介意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll keep first watch. I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.52,0:11:52.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.42,0:12:10.15,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说我们可以重新开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said we get to start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.39,0:12:12.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.53,0:12:15.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这样做了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.35,0:12:18.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.17,0:12:33.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想说什么就说吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you say what's really on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.49,0:12:38.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们不会再继续救人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think we get to save people anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.01,0:12:47.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么来这里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.62,0:12:52.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.07,0:13:05.69,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在车旁边的时候…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we were out by the car...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.01,0:13:09.49,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我没有出现呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what if I didn't show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.89,0:13:13.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.19,0:14:28.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不必这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.77,0:14:32.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不必\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.03,0:15:55.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.71,0:16:44.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车是往市中心去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That car was headed downtown.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.56,0:16:47.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们找一栋高楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say we get up in one of the tall ones,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.89,0:16:49.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,登高望远 看看情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}get ourselves a view, see what we see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.85,0:16:51.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以沿着建筑物潜行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can stay close to the buildings and keep quiet,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.96,0:16:55.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但迟早还是会引到行尸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but sooner or later, we're gonna be drawing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:44.37,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 可以从那儿上去 有座桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, we can get up there. There's a bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.79,0:19:28.85,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候 我真是已经麻木无语了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some days, I don't know what the hell to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.55,0:20:19.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸好我们没吃早饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good thing we skipped breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.43,0:21:05.96,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么到这来了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did we get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.68,0:21:10.77,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这么来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.39,0:21:18.45,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没问"发生了什么事"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still haven't asked me what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.46,0:21:22.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我遇到泰尔西和姑娘们之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After I met up with Tyreese, the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.36,0:21:23.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.10,0:21:26.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们没来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They ain't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.00,0:21:30.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比这还糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was worse than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.06,0:21:41.42,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之所以说我们要重新开始…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The reason I said we get to start over...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.47,0:21:43.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为我们必须这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is because we gotta.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.03,0:21:50.29,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像从前一样…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.86,0:21:57.88,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.29,0:22:07.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到什么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see something?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.15,0:22:10.57,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道 把枪给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Hand me that rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.48,0:22:29.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.90,0:22:39.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经在那停了一段时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been there a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.02,0:22:44.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是那些人的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Definitely one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.84,0:22:46.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是个线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's definitely some kind of lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.04,0:22:53.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们赶紧补给吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should fill up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.56,0:22:55.58,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.37,0:23:14.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.83,0:23:18.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜这肯定花了某个阔佬一大笔钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet this cost some rich prick a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.24,0:23:25.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像一只狗坐在了油墨上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like a dog sat in paint,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.23,0:23:27.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在整张画里蹭屁股\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wiped its ass all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.38,0:23:32.03,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗？我还挺喜欢的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? I kinda like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.55,0:23:35.62,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.25,0:23:37.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是认真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.61,0:23:40.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又不了解我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.14,0:23:47.10,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 继续骗自己吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep, you keep telling yourself that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.16,0:24:11.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 别出来 达里尔 - 站起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Daryl, don't. - Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.40,0:24:13.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,举起手来 你们俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hands up, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.81,0:24:20.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下弩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lay down your crossbow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.42,0:24:22.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是有种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got some sack on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.75,0:24:23.52,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我不想伤害任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, nobody has to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.52,0:24:25.08,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是需要武器 就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just need weapons, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.55,0:24:29.07,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以请放下弩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, please, lay down your crossbow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.15,0:24:40.21,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.04,0:24:51.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.73,0:24:53.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看上去挺强的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.12,0:24:56.23,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.20,0:25:26.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还剩三发子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.83,0:25:30.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们困在市中心 他抢了我们的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in the middle of a city. He was stealing our weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.72,0:25:34.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我刚才是要杀他吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you think I was gonna kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.83,0:25:38.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我瞄的是他的腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was aiming for his leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.08,0:25:40.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有可能会杀了他吗？可能吧 说不准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could that have killed him? Maybe, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.66,0:25:42.63,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他抢了我们的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he was stealing our weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.63,0:25:44.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只是个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a damn kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.31,0:25:47.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有武器我们会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without weapons we could die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.37,0:25:48.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝丝会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beth could die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.05,0:25:50.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会找到更多武器的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll find more weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.85,0:25:54.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想让你死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want you to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.53,0:25:55.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想让贝丝死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want Beth to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.70,0:25:57.37,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想让教堂里的任何人死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want anybody at the church to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.37,0:26:00.31,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我也不能眼睁睁地看着他们死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I can't stand around and watch it happen either.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.94,0:26:03.14,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能 所以我走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't. That's why I left.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.15,0:26:05.06,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是必须去别的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just had to be somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.06,0:26:07.37,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不在别的地方 你就在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you ain't somewhere else; you're right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.18,0:26:09.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在努力着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.71,0:26:15.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不再是以前的你了 我也不是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, you're not who you were and neither am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.76,0:26:21.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我还相不相信上帝和天堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if I believe in God anymore or heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.02,0:26:23.73,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是如果我以后会下地狱 我要尽可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but if I'm going to hell, I'm making damn sure
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.73,0:26:25.67,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拖得久一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm holding it off as long as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.77,0:27:49.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我们开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's get this done.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.82,0:27:52.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车不稳 我体重轻点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not stable. I'm lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.48,0:28:36.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,越来越多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's more coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.24,0:28:38.91,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得杀出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna have to fight through.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.91,0:28:40.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我看见它们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.46,0:28:44.54,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.54,0:28:45.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,GMH 那是什么？医院吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}GMH, what's that? A hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.71,0:28:47.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道 可能是格拉迪纪念医院吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Grady Memorial, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.44,0:28:50.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格拉迪 白十字 可能他们就藏在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grady, the white crosses... it might be where they're holing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.91,0:28:58.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.35,0:29:01.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.29,0:29:24.00,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有能利用的东西？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything we can use?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.00,0:29:25.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了我们自己带的 再无其他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothin' but what we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.12,0:29:34.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.53,0:29:35.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,系好安全带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}buckle up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.72,0:29:55.78,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你抓牢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.85,0:30:17.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.53,0:30:20.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们还活着 - 上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're okay. - God.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.26,0:31:32.19,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.42,0:31:33.47,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.80,0:31:34.77,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,证明给我看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.86,0:31:48.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你伤得重吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How bad is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.72,0:31:49.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我经历过更糟的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.48,0:31:59.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死 那样真愚蠢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, that was stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.54,0:32:01.07,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样下来更快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We made good time down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.54,0:32:08.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们和格拉迪医院之间只隔着三个街区了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only three blocks between us and Grady.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.29,0:32:12.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得在附近找个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to find a place nearby,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.36,0:32:15.40,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,观察一下那里 看看能发现什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}scope it out, see what we can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.61,0:32:20.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为只用看 我们就能搞清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really think we're gonna find out what we need to know
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.46,0:32:21.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要了解的事吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just by watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.91,0:32:25.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们从观察入手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's where we start.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.52,0:32:26.46,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.09,0:32:55.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.27,0:33:05.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.95,0:33:08.36,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们开始观察吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see what we see.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.58,0:33:29.71,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说我现在跟以前不一样了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said I ain't like how I was before?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.01,0:33:31.74,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.41,0:33:34.51,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我以前什么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.22,0:33:38.72,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以前像个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like you were a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.21,0:33:43.33,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在长大成人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.70,0:33:48.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.50,0:34:02.01,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和索菲亚在那个庇护所待了一天半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me and Sophia stayed at that shelter for a day and a half
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.98,0:34:04.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后回到爱德那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before I went running back to Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.24,0:34:07.97,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回到家 被暴打一顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went home, I got beat up,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.20,0:34:09.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生活继续 然后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}life went on, and ...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.99,0:34:13.79,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是不停地祈祷可以发生一些事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just kept praying for something to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.36,0:34:17.11,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我什么也没做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.82,0:34:20.37,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他妈什么都没做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.72,0:34:27.27,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟他在一起的那个我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was with him...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.45,0:34:29.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她已经死掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she got burned away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.87,0:34:33.21,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这让我感到开心 也不是开心 但就是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I was happy about that. I mean, not happy, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.94,0:34:35.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在监狱的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and at the prison
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.31,0:34:40.26,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我成为了我一直认为自己应该成为的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to be who I always thought I should be,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.41,0:34:42.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早该成为的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thought I should've been.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.90,0:34:48.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是她也死掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then she got burned away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.61,0:34:56.61,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的一切都只是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything now just...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.26,0:34:58.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在燃烧消耗你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}consumes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.84,0:35:09.41,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们又不是灰烬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We ain't ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.19,0:35:54.28,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你的箭吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.49,0:35:56.48,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.35,0:36:20.60,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.12,0:36:24.18,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.91,0:36:26.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事 你快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good. You go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.24,0:36:29.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.38,0:36:59.87,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了 我总得保护自己啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plea... please. I had to protect myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.87,0:37:01.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你为什么跟着我们？- 我没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why you following us? - I-I didn't,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.56,0:37:03.35,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓 我以为你们在跟踪我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear! I thought you followed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.35,0:37:04.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扯蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.25,0:37:17.44,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 兄弟 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man. Plea... please!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.29,0:37:23.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 求你了 - 不行 我已经救过你一次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please, please. - Nah, I already helped you once.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.48,0:37:26.02,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能再救你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It ain't happening again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.90,0:37:36.56,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟那个行尸好好玩吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have fun with Hoss over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.56,0:37:37.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.80,0:37:40.20,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不不 求你了 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, no, no! Please! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.20,0:37:41.99,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了 对不起 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please! I'm sorry, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.99,0:37:44.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 求你了 求你了 - 达里尔 停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please! Please, please! - Daryl. Daryl. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.86,0:37:47.05,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你差点因为他死掉 - 但我没死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You almost died because of him! - But I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.59,0:37:55.16,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 随他去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah, let him be.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.89,0:38:01.24,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 对不起 求你了 对不起 - 达里尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm sorry. Please, I'm sorry! - Daryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.79,0:39:18.25,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加把劲 再出来点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, just a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.38,0:39:21.82,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 谢谢 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.85,0:39:27.83,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.77,0:39:32.76,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.72,0:39:34.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还活着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.28,0:39:38.30,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得走了 我得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta go. I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.30,0:39:40.75,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会来的 他们应该听到枪声了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're gonna come. They probably heard the shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.75,0:39:41.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们找到我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they find me...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.60,0:39:45.09,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 谁？- 他们 医院的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who? - Them, people at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.09,0:39:47.55,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 告诉我们 那里有没有一个金发女孩？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait, wait, just tell us... is there a blonde girl there?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.55,0:39:49.95,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你见过一个金发女孩吗？- 贝丝？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You see a blonde girl? - Beth?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.08,0:39:52.13,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认识她吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.22,0:39:56.34,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她帮我逃了出来 但她还在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She helped me get out, but she's still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.01,0:40:00.12,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.78,0:40:03.93,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得立刻走 我们得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta go now. We gotta go. We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.87,0:40:09.04,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隔壁的大楼有个地下室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The building next door has a basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.05,0:40:10.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里没行尸 很安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's clear. We'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.42,0:40:14.66,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走 我扶他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.87,0:40:16.90,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.01,0:40:18.65,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 起来 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get up. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.13,0:40:26.70,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no! Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.70,0:40:28.53,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 放开我 - 等等 他们能救她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let go of me! - Wait! They can help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.53,0:40:29.60,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有他们能救她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're the only ones who can.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.60,0:40:32.80,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有药 仪器 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have medicine, machines, a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.32,0:40:36.50,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你出去 就必须杀了他们 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go out there, you'll have to kill them, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.58,0:40:38.94,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后她就得不到救治了 你想这样吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then she can't get their help. Is that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.18,0:40:44.59,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能救回她 我们能救回贝丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can get her back. We can get Beth back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.89,0:40:49.22,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救她们要付出多大代价？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's it gonna take?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.90,0:40:51.92,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.24,0:40:54.45,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got guns,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.40,0:40:56.38,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}people.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.67,0:40:59.89,中上英下,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So do we.
